ext-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Loan term is 120 months and rates range from 9.99% &#8211; 22.99% APR. Loan amount and rate will vary based on your income and creditworthiness. </p>\n\n<a href=\"https://projects.greensky.com/MerchantLoanApplication?apptype=short&#038;merchant=81086361&#038;dealerplan=9991&#038;channel=External-Button-03\" target=\"_blank\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"false\" class=\"cta align-self-right\">\n    <span >Go to Greensky</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n    </div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group multi-component-container multi-component-container--2-up multi-component-container--uniform-height has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div  class=\"card flow  wp-elements-9 has-white-background-color has-text-color has-black-color\" style=\"padding-top:1.33rem;padding-bottom:1.33rem;padding-left:1.33rem;padding-right:1.33rem;\">\n            <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"396\" height=\"162\" src=\"/images/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo.jpg\" alt=\"Greensky logo\" class=\"wp-image-17\" style=\"width:222px;height:auto\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo.jpg 396w, /images/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo-300x123.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 396px) 100vw, 396px\" /></figure>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>No Interest if Paid in Full in 12 Months</strong></h3>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Subject to credit approval. Minimum monthly payments required. Interest is billed during the promotional period, but all interest is waived if the purchase amount is paid in full within 12 months. </p>\n\n<a href=\"https://projects.greensky.com/MerchantLoanApplication?apptype=short&#038;merchant=81086361&#038;dealerplan=2613&#038;channel=External-Button-03\" target=\"_blank\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"false\" class=\"cta align-self-right\">\n    <span >Go to Greensky</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n    </div>\n\n<div  class=\"card flow  wp-elements-10 has-white-background-color has-text-color has-black-color\" style=\"padding-top:1.33rem;padding-bottom:1.33rem;padding-left:1.33rem;padding-right:1.33rem;\">\n            <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"396\" height=\"162\" src=\"/images/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo.jpg\" alt=\"Greensky logo\" class=\"wp-image-17\" style=\"width:222px;height:auto\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo.jpg 396w, /images/2024/02/Financing-Greensky-logo-300x123.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 396px) 100vw, 396px\" /></figure>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>No Interest if Paid in Full in 18 Months</strong></h3>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Subject to credit approval. Minimum monthly payments required. Interest is billed during the promotional period, but all interest is waived if the purchase amount is paid in full within 12 months. </p>\n\n<a href=\"https://projects.greensky.com/MerchantLoanApplication?apptype=short&#038;merchant=81086361&#038;dealerplan=2631&#038;channel=External-Button-03\" target=\"_blank\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"false\" class=\"cta align-self-right\">\n    <span >Go to Greensky</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n    </div></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group multi-component-container multi-component-container--2-up multi-component-container--uniform-height has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div  class=\"card flow  wp-elements-11 has-white-background-color has-text-color has-black-color\" style=\"padding-top:1.33rem;padding-bottom:1.33rem;padding-left:1.33rem;padding-right:1.33rem;\">\n            <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"728\" height=\"165\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Upgrade-logo.png\" alt=\"Upgrade logo\" class=\"wp-image-4793\" style=\"width:222px;height:auto\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/Upgrade-logo.png 728w, /images/2024/03/Upgrade-logo-300x68.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 728px) 100vw, 728px\" /></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"957\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/images/2026/01/equal-housing-opportunity-logo-1200w-1-957x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-6956\" style=\"width:120px;height:auto\" srcset=\"/images/2026/01/equal-housing-opportunity-logo-1200w-1-957x1024.png 957w, /images/2026/01/equal-housing-opportunity-logo-1200w-1-280x300.png 280w, /images/2026/01/equal-housing-opportunity-logo-1200w-1-768x822.png 768w, /images/2026/01/equal-housing-opportunity-logo-1200w-1.png 1130w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 957px) 100vw, 957px\" /></figure>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Monthly Payments to Fit your Budget!</h3>\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Special terms and promotions available. Online account management and bill payment options. View details on the Upgrade site.</p>\n\n<a href=\"https://upgrade.com/h/szSnj944J8\" target=\"_blank\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"false\" class=\"cta align-self-right\">\n    <span >Go to Upgrade</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n    </div></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Flexible Financing for Indoor Air Quality System Replacements</h2>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Flexible Financing for Indoor Air Quality Systems</strong></p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Improving your home&#8217;s indoor air quality shouldn’t strain your budget. With 2nd Wind Heating &amp; Air Conditioning&#8217;s flexible financing options, you can invest in advanced air purification systems, humidifiers, dehumidifiers, or UV lights without the upfront financial stress. Breathe easier knowing you can make manageable monthly payments while enjoying cleaner, healthier air for your family. Call us today to get started on enhancing your home&#8217;s air quality.</p>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Flexible Financing With our Partners at Greensky and Upgrade</h2>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2nd Wind Heating &amp; Air Conditioning partners with trusted financing providers to make your indoor air quality upgrades accessible and affordable. Here’s what you can expect:</p>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Monthly Payment Plans:</strong>&nbsp;Customizable plans to fit your budget.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Promotional Rates:</strong>&nbsp;Special terms and reduced interest rates during promotional periods.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Online Account Management:</strong>&nbsp;Track your payments and manage your account conveniently online.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Indoor Air Quality Systems Costs by Type</strong></h2>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">2nd Wind Heating &amp; Air Conditioning offers a variety of cutting-edge indoor air quality solutions tailored to the unique needs of homes in Columbia and the surrounding areas. Here’s a breakdown of common systems and their average costs:</p>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality-columbia-sc\" title=\"Indoor Air Quality\">Whole-Home Air Purifiers:</a></h5>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Cost</strong>: $1,500 &#8211; $4,000</li>\n\n<li><strong>Benefits</strong>: Removes airborne contaminants like pollen, dust, and allergens. Ideal for families with allergies or asthma, ensuring every breath is cleaner and healthier.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality-columbia-sc/dehumidifiers\" title=\"Dehumidifiers\">Dehumidifiers:</a></h5>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Cost</strong>: $1,200 &#8211; $2,800</li>\n\n<li><strong>Benefits</strong>: Reduces excess moisture, preventing mold growth and improving overall comfort. Perfect for homes in humid climates like Columbia. </li>\n</ul>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality-columbia-sc/humidifiers\" title=\"Humidifiers\">Humidifiers:</a></h5>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Cost</strong>: $1,200 &#8211; $2,500</li>\n\n<li><strong>Benefits</strong>: Adds moisture to dry indoor air, preventing static electricity, dry skin, and respiratory discomfort during winter months.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"/winter-2024-indoor-air-quality-promotion\" title=\"Expert and Professional Air Purification Services in Columbus Surrounding Areas\">UV Light Air Purification Systems:</a></h5>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Cost</strong>: $1,500 &#8211; $3,000</li>\n\n<li><strong>Benefits</strong>: Eliminates bacteria, viruses, and mold spores from your HVAC system, providing an added layer of health protection for your family.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Indoor Air Quality Upgrades</h2>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For homeowners looking to take control of their air quality, consider these advanced upgrades:</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"/services/indoor-air-quality-columbia-sc/air-scrubbers\" title=\"Air Scrubbers\">Air Scrubbers</a></strong></p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>These systems attach to your HVAC unit and use advanced filtration to reduce airborne pathogens, allergens, and odors. Air scrubbers are ideal for households with pets or individuals with respiratory sensitivities.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Energy Recovery Ventilators (ERVs)</strong></p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>ERVs bring fresh air into your home while retaining the energy from outgoing air. They’re perfect for energy-efficient homes where fresh air circulation is limited, ensuring a constant flow of healthy air.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"/services/cooling-columbia-sc\" title=\"Cooling\">Zoning Systems for Air Quality</a></strong></p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Divide your home into zones with independent air quality controls to ensure each area receives the proper treatment it needs. Zoning systems allow you to target problem areas, optimizing comfort and efficiency.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Choose 2nd Wind Heating &amp; Air Conditioning for Indoor Air Quality Solutions?</h2>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With decades of experience serving the Columbia area, 2nd Wind Heating &amp; Air Conditioning is your trusted partner for improving indoor air quality. Here’s why homeowners in Columbia and the surrounding areas choose us:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Expert Guidance</strong>: Our team will help you select the right indoor air quality system for your needs and budget.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Tailored Financing Options</strong>: Flexible plans to make your investment affordable and stress-free.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Certified Technicians</strong>: Our experts ensure precise installation for maximum effectiveness.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Commitment to Health and Comfort</strong>: We prioritize creating healthier, more comfortable homes for our community.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n<div style=\"height:15px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-6551 -->"
}